<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p>Some links on this site are affiliate links to Amazon search results for parts and diagnostic tools related to component groups owners name in complaints. If you buy through one of those links, this site may earn a commission, at no extra cost to you. The link is a normal amazon.com search. It is not a diagnosis, and it does not mean a part fixes a recall. Recall repairs are free at a dealer.</p>
<p>Affiliate relationships never change the complaint and recall data, which comes straight from NHTSA public APIs. How those counts are made is on the <a href="/about/">method and sources</a> page.</p>
<p>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
